WEBVTT

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.520
Why was I so wrong?

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.680
To find out, I've been studying people
that I come to call "originals."

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.016
Originals are nonconformists,

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.456
people who not only have new ideas

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.320
but take action to champion them.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.456
They are people
who stand out and speak up.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.416
Originals drive creativity
and change in the world.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:19.576
They're the people you want to bet on.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.000
And they look nothing like I expected.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.176
I want to show you today
three things I've learned

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.216
about recognizing originals

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:29.640
and becoming a little bit more like them.